Google Cloud Artifact Registry (recommended) or the older Container Registry (GCR) using Docker, follow these steps.
gcloud auth login
gcloud config set project PROJECT_ID
gcloud auth configure-docker us-central1-docker.pkg.dev
docker tag myapp us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/PROJECT_ID/REPOSITORY/myapp:v1
docker push us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/PROJECT_ID/REPOSITORY/myapp:v1
